{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "vercel-clone-complete-api-2024",
		"name": "🚀 Vercel Clone Platform - Complete API Test Suite",
		"description": "Complete API testing collection for Vercel Clone Platform with 3-server Oracle Cloud architecture:\n\n**Architecture:**\n- **EC1**: API Server (localhost:5000) - Backend APIs, Admin Panel, Database\n- **EC2**: Shared Users Server (:3001) - Free/Trial users containers\n- **EC3**: Paid Users Server (:3001) - Paid users containers\n\n**Features Tested:**\n- Authentication (GitHub OAuth + JWT)\n- Admin Container Management (Resource allocation, Server migration)\n- User Management & Plans\n- Project & Deployment Management\n- Payment Processing (Payoneer)\n- Container Host Agents (EC2/EC3)\n- Webhooks & Integrations\n\n**Setup Instructions:**\n1. Update environment variables with your server IPs\n2. Start MongoDB: `docker-compose up mongodb`\n3. Start Backend: `npm run dev` (in backend folder)\n4. Deploy container agents on EC2/EC3 using `deploy-container-host.sh`\n5. Run tests in order: Health → Auth → Admin → Projects\n\nBuilt by: Vercel Clone Platform Team",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
